{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は福家書店新宿サブナード店で\n「季刊 乃木坂」のお渡し会でした！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかった〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Vol.1に出てる9人で3人×3列でお渡ししたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/03/07/9695357/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田はC列の\n若月、ひめたん、中田レーン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/03/07/9695357/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんが『季刊 乃木坂』\n中田が特典生写真\n若月がいれる袋"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"を渡したって感じ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お渡し会特典の生写真は\nお渡し会でしかもらえない限定の生写真で\n直筆サイン入りもあったよ＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新制服でみなさんに会うのは\n初めてだったし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3人レーンは全握でも少ないのに\n3人と話せて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"神イベでしたね(*°-°*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日来てくれたかたは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のために会員になって当ててくれたかたとか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"整理券配布で朝から並んでくれたかたとか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に嬉しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/03/07/9695357/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかも、整理券を配布した日は\n横浜個別の日とかぶってたから\n1部に間に合うように朝から並んで\n整理券をもらってから\n握手会に来てくれたかたも\nいっぱいいますよね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます○┓"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph",